<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 76, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>为什么需要智能诊断</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FC0F0' }}>01 临床背景与数据</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 604, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 28, paddingTop: 20, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingBottom: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 344, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, gap: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#CFE0F7' }}>全数据集影像总数</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 76, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', lineHeight: 1 }}>780</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#8FC0F0' }}>张 · 来自 600 位女性患者</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FDECEC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, gap: 6, border: '1px solid #F5C6C4' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#B03430' }}>其中恶性样本</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 56, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', lineHeight: 1 }}>210</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#B03430' }}>张 / 26.9%</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 20, gap: 10, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>读片的三重压力</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    良恶性病灶在灰阶超声上边界模糊、形态重叠；不同年资医师判读一致性有限；基层医院缺乏资深超声医师。
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 4 }}>
                    → AI 的价值不是替代医生，而是提供可复现的第二意见。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 18, paddingTop: 10, paddingBottom: 10 }}>
                <FAIcon name='info-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>引导问题：这份数据最突出的结构性矛盾是什么？</Text>
            </Box>
            <Chart
                style={{ height: 252 }}
                chartType='barChart'
                barDirection='column'
                title='BUSI 数据集类别分布（张）'
                titleColor='#0E3F8C'
                showLegend={false}
                showDataLabels={true}
                axisColor='#8B97A8'
                dataLabelColor='#1A2230'
                colors={['#3D7BD9', '#D9534F', '#8B97A8']}
                background='#FFFFFF'
                data={[
                    ['类别', '图像数量'],
                    ['良性 benign', 437],
                    ['恶性 malignant', 210],
                    ['正常 normal', 133],
                ]}
            />
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Image src="assets/sample_benign.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 88, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>良性 437</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #F5C6C4', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Image src="assets/sample_malignant.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 88, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F' }}>恶性 210</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 8, padding: 10, alignItems: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
                    <Image src="assets/sample_normal.png" style={{ width: '100%', height: 88, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>正常 133</Text>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFF8E1', borderLeft: '5px solid #FFC107', borderRadius: 6, padding: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>数据判断：</span>恶性样本只有良性的 48%，模型会天然偏向多数类。780 张也远小于 ImageNet 的百万量级——这直接决定了后续必须用迁移学习与类别加权。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>BUSI 乳腺超声图像分类 · 乳腺癌智能诊断</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>04 / 38</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
